# Packages installed INTO the kiosk image by mmdebstrap (--include).
# Derived from os-builder/configure-rootfs.sh, plus what a bootable live
# system needs. Ansible (run via the chroot connection) now only does
# configuration — package installs happen here so they come from the pinned
# live+snapshot sources as part of the deterministic bootstrap.
#
# Bare package names, one per line. `#` starts a comment anywhere on a line.
# After editing, run `make rootfs-update` to regenerate the version + hash locks
# — the build installs from the LOCK, not from this file, so a package added
# here without relocking silently never appears in the image.

# --- base / boot ---

linux-image-amd64
dracut               # initramfs with the rootovl overlay (initramfs-tools lacks systemd)
systemd
systemd-sysv
udev
ca-certificates
debian-archive-keyring
gnupg
parted

# --- X / GUI stack (electron app) ---
# xserver-xorg + xinit pull a slim X server (no xterm/twm/extra fonts); the rest
# are Electron/Chromium's GTK runtime libraries.

xserver-xorg
xserver-xorg-video-all
xinit
x11-xserver-utils
libgtk-3-0
libnss3
libnotify4
libasound2
libxtst6
libxss1
libglib2.0-bin
xdg-utils
zlib1g

# --- firmware (modern hardware / laptops) ---

firmware-linux-free
